<%- include('./partials/header', { title: 'About - StudentCalc Blog' }) %>

<main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 w-full">

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="mb-14">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-blue-600 mb-3">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 leading-tight mb-5" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">
      Clear, honest writing on tech, science, health and food.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      StudentCalc is an independent blog created by two students. It started as a project to learn
      web development and grew into a place where we explain the topics we keep reading about,
      in plain language and without the clutter.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Why -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">Why this blog exists</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Good articles are often long, full of jargon, or hard to find. We wanted a clean, fast
        site where complicated ideas are explained simply, so readers can understand a topic
        in a few minutes and decide whether to dig deeper.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site itself is part of the project. We built it from scratch with Node.js, Express,
        MongoDB and Tailwind CSS, including secure logins, an admin panel and the like system.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Topics -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">What you will find here</h2>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/?category=Technology" class="block border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-4 hover:border-zinc-950 transition">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Technology</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1">Gadgets, software and the ideas shaping how we use them.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/?category=Science" class="block border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-4 hover:border-zinc-950 transition">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Science</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1">Research and discoveries, explained without the jargon.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/?category=Health" class="block border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-4 hover:border-zinc-950 transition">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Health</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1">Everyday wellbeing, habits and what the evidence says.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/?category=Food" class="block border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-4 hover:border-zinc-950 transition">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950">Food</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1">What we eat, why it matters, and the culture around it.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Editorial standards -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">Editorial standards</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5">
      <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Sources are credited.</strong> When a post draws on someone else's reporting or research, we name the source and link to it.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Corrections are welcome.</strong> If we get something wrong, let us know. We will fix it and note the change.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Not medical advice.</strong> Health content is for general information only and is not a substitute for advice from a qualified professional.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-zinc-950">Independence.</strong> What we write is never influenced by advertisers or sponsors.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Funding -->
  <section class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">How this site is funded</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        StudentCalc is a self-funded project. In the future, we may support it with display ads
        or affiliate links. If that happens, ads will be clearly separated from editorial content,
        and any post containing affiliate links will say so up front.
      </p>
      <p>
        Accounts are used only so you can like posts. Passwords are securely hashed and never
        stored in plain text. If we add ads or analytics later, they may use cookies, and we will
        explain exactly how in our <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Authors -->
  <section class="mb-12 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-5" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">Who writes this</h2>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950 text-lg">[Name 1]</h3>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-0.5">[Role, e.g. Writer and Developer]</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          [Course / year] student based in [city]. Interested in [interests]. Outside of writing, [one real hobby].
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-zinc-200 rounded-md p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-zinc-950 text-lg">[Name 2]</h3>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-0.5">[Role, e.g. Writer and Editor]</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          [Course / year] student based in [city]. Interested in [interests]. Outside of writing, [one real hobby].
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section class="rounded-md bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 p-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-950 mb-2" style="font-family: 'Google Sans Code';">Get in touch</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
      Found a mistake, have a topic suggestion, or want to work together? We read every message.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:[your-email@example.com]" class="font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:underline">[your-email@example.com]</a>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('./partials/footer') %>